SORT 'tb': a table SORT names an entry with an OCCURS clause (2023 14.9.40.3 rule 13)
SORT key 'w' is not 'te' or an item inside it (2023 14.9.40.3 rule 14a)
SORT key 'to2' has an OCCURS clause or is in a table inside 'te' (2023 14.9.40.3 rule 14e)
SORT key 'tb1' is boolean (2023 14.9.40.3 rule 14c)
SORT 'te' without a KEY phrase: its OCCURS clause has no KEY either (2023 14.9.40.3 rule 15)
